+ ## Variantes

- ```tabular
+ ```tabular

- column  Code
- column  Reason
- column  Message
+ column  Código
+ column  Motivo
+ column  Mensagem

- row  `↯/s.68.2.1`  `Unreadable`  `[↯/s.68.2.1] the vocabulary could not be read`
+ row  `↯/s.68.2.1`  `Unreadable`  `[↯/s.68.2.1] the vocabulary could not be read`

- row  `↯/s.68.2.2`  `OutOfRange`  `[↯/s.68.2.2] the number <n> is outside the representable range`
